      "narrativeId": "n-ai-inference-markets",
      "reason": "Three coins on Pons whose own metadata names the mechanism: useorbix.app (AI inference marketplace, $231K), Orbio.so (inference credits for holders, $209K) and Raeto (tokenized stocks pay for AI inference, $108K), $547,941 of rolling 24h volume together (bar $500K). Independent sources beyond the metadata: the official pages useorbix.app (e3:0) and orbio.so (e3:1) and @RaetoCC's posts of 2026-10-18 and 2026-10-19 (e3:3), plus third-party posts of 2026-10-21 and 2026-10-23 (e2:4, e3:2). All three are unflagged. ORBIX's market cap ($67K) is under the written $100K member bar and it was added on the volume bar and its own metadata (flagged for the owner). Created at the six-narrative cap by pausing Kimchi coins, the weakest ($151K)."
